    # 직배송인 경우 ProductVariontRegion 정보로, 보스몰에서 요청시에는 BrandProductVariant 또는 BrandProductVariantRegion 의 정보로
    def resolve_delivery_fee_amount(root: ProductVariantModel, info):
        context = info.context
        requestor = context.user
        if requestor.is_authenticated and requestor.from_dashboard:
            region = requestor.region if requestor else None
            if region is None:
                return root.delivery_fee_amount

            product = ProductByIdAllLoader(context).load(root.product_id)

            def get_value_with_product(product):
                if product.is_direct_shipping:

                    def get_value_with_product_variant_regions(product_variant_regions):
                        product_variant_region = next(
                            (
                                item
                                for item in product_variant_regions
                                if item.region_id == region.id
                            ),
                            None,
                        )
                        if product_variant_region:
                            return product_variant_region.delivery_fee_amount
                        return None

                    product_variant_regions = ProductVariantRegionsByProductVariantIdLoader(
                        info.context
                    ).load(root.id)
                    return product_variant_regions.then(get_value_with_product_variant_regions)

                return root.delivery_fee_amount

            return product.then(get_value_with_product)
        else:

            def handle_result(result):
                if len(result) == 0:
                    return None
                return result[0].delivery_fee_amount

            return (
                ProductByIdAllLoader(info.context)
                .load(root.product_id)
                .then(
                    lambda product: (
                        get_user_product_variant_for_loader(
                            variant=root,
                            product=product,
                            context=info.context,
                            raise_exception=False,
                        ).then(handle_result)
                        if product
                        else None
                    )
                )
            )

